t starts with NT$, currency is TWD.\",\n \"enum\": [\"TWD\", \"USD\", \"JPY\", \"EUR\", \"SGD\"],\n \"examples\": [\"USD\", \"TWD\"]\n }\n },\n \"required\": [\"date\", \"amount\", \"category\", \"currency\"]\n}",
